  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together smoky paprika, garlic powder, lemon juice, olive oil, honey, salt, black pepper, and Saudi Arabian kebab spices",
    "Add the king prawns to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade",
    "Thread the marinated king prawns onto skewers",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8 minutes per side, or until the prawns are pink and cooked through",
    "Brush the kebabs with the remaining marinade during the last 2 minutes of cooking",
    "Serve the kebabs hot, garnished with fresh parsley and lemon wedges",
    "Let the kebabs rest for 2 minutes before serving"
